# The sky pass's exposure during a solar eclipse (2026-10-06): sat_sky.frag must adapt to the eclipse sky light
# exactly as SatelliteSim::skyExposure() does (the probes, the bloom and the post-tonemap terms use that one).
# state's moon block reports sky_light_frac and sky_exposure. The 2037-07-13 totality over central Australia.
preset High
set clouds_v2.fog_amount 0
set clouds_v2.coverage 0
set clouds_v2.auto_exposure 0
time pause
time set 2037-07-10T00:00:00Z
eclipse solar
camera look sun
camera fov=90 el=20
wait settle
capture ecl_tot_sunward
state ecl_tot
camera az=183 el=10 fov=90
wait settle
capture ecl_tot_away
time add -1500
camera look sun
camera fov=90 el=20
wait settle
capture ecl_partial
state ecl_partial
quit
